  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund Surgery and Education for 3 Orphans in Kumbo.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will fund the surgery of an orphan and the education of this child and his two brothers, who are helpless due to poverty and lost of their father. The project will fund complete medical surgery for a  15 year old boy, &quot;A&quot;, who has been suffering from growth since he was about 5 years old. Additionally, it will provide educational support for him and his two brothers, &quot;B and C&quot; by paying their tuition fees, books, uniform and shoes for 5 years in Kumbo.</narrative>
  </description>
